><td align="center">-0.32</td><td align="center"><bold>0.74</bold></td><td align="center">0.20</td><td align="center">0.64</td><td align="center">-0.62</td><td align="center">0.69</td><td align="center"><bold>-0.72</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left">2</td><td align="left"><italic>AAPT1</italic></td><td align="center">-0.52</td><td align="center"><bold>0.82</bold></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.89</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><bold>-0.83</bold></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.86</bold></underline></td><td align="center">-0.20</td><td align="center">-0.51</td><td align="center">0.59</td><td align="center">0.67</td><td align="center">-0.55</td><td align="center">0.62</td><td align="center">0.29</td><td align="center">0.57</td><td align="center">-0.55</td><td align="center"><bold>0.78</bold></td><td align="center">-0.43</td></tr><tr><td align="left">2</td><td align="left"><italic>KCR2</italic></td><td align="center">-0.48</td><td align="center"><bold>0.77</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>0.82</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>-0.80</bold></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.86</bold></underline></td><td align="center">-0.06</td><td align="center"><underline><bold>-0.84</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.95</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.95</bold></underline></td><td align="center">-0.39</td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.94</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><underline>0.14</underline></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.90</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>-0.86</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><bold>0.82</bold></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>-0.85</bold></underline></td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>FAE1</italic></td><td align="center">0.49</td><td align="center">-0.57</td><td align="center">-0.61</td><td align="center">0.58</td><td align="center">-0.61</td><td align="center">0.58</td><td align="center"><bold>0.75</bold></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>-0.88</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>-0.84</bold></underline></td><td align="center">0.21</td><td align="center"><underline><bold>-0.87</bold></underline></td><td align="center">0.18</td><td align="center">-0.63</td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.89</bold></underline></td><td align="center">-0.67</td><td align="center"><bold>0.78</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>Napin</italic></td><td align="center">0.43</td><td align="center">-0.51</td><td align="center">-0.49</td><td align="center">0.45</td><td align="center">-0.32</td><td align="center">0.06</td><td align="center">0.59</td><td align="center">-0.65</td><td align="center">-0.61</td><td align="center">-0.02</td><td align="center">-0.64</td><td align="center">-0.48</td><td align="center">-0.59</td><td align="center">0.45</td><td align="center">-0.43</td><td align="center"><bold>0.81</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>&#x003b1;-CT</italic></td><td align="center">-0.46</td><td align="center"><bold>0.76</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>0.80</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>-0.74</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>0.74</bold></td><td align="center">-0.14</td><td align="center">0.03</td><td align="center">0.12</td><td align="center">0.08</td><td align="center">0.07</td><td align="center">0.08</td><td align="center">0.47</td><td align="center">-0.02</td><td align="center">0.08</td><td align="center">0.07</td><td align="center">-0.27</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>KAS1</italic></td><td align="center">-0.29</td><td align="center">0.35</td><td align="center">0.35</td><td align="center">-0.34</td><td align="center">0.26</td><td align="center">0.11</td><td align="center">-0.59</td><td align="center">0.55</td><td align="center">0.48</td><td align="center">0.51</td><td align="center">0.63</td><td align="center">0.18</td><td align="center">0.27</td><td align="center">-0.56</td><td align="center">0.10</td><td align="center"><underline><bold>-0.89</bold></underline></td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>KAS2</italic></td><td align="center">-0.50</td><td align="center"><bold>0.75</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>0.73</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>-0.72</bold></td><td align="center">0.69</td><td align="center">0.31</td><td align="center">-0.43</td><td align="center">0.40</td><td align="center">0.30</td><td align="center">0.18</td><td align="center">0.30</td><td align="center">0.02</td><td align="center">0.13</td><td align="center">-0.31</td><td align="center">0.11</td><td align="center">-0.48</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>&#x003b2;-actin</italic></td><td align="center">0.38</td><td align="center">-0.40</td><td align="center">-0.48</td><td align="center">0.46</td><td align="center">-0.56</td><td align="center"><bold>0.77</bold></td><td align="center">-0.07</td><td align="center">-0.13</td><td align="center">-0.08</td><td align="center">-0.45</td><td align="center">-0.20</td><td align="center">0.54</td><td align="center">0.06</td><td align="center">0.23</td><td align="center">0.15</td><td align="center">0.29</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>BcRK6</italic></td><td align="center">-0.46</td><td align="center"><bold>0.79</bold></td><td align="center"><underline><bold>0.85</bold></underline></td><td align="center"><bold>-0.79</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>0.80</bold></td><td align="center">-0.19</td><td align="center">-0.28</td><td align="center">0.35</td><td align="center">0.32</td><td align="center">0.03</td><td align="center">0.32</td><td align="center">0.36</td><td align="center">0.12</td><td align="center">-0.22</td><td align="center">0.25</td><td align="center">-0.46</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1</td><td align="left"><italic>KAS3</italic></td><td align="center">-0.47</td><td alig